ARCHITECTURE

This repository contains a public renderer shell (index.html) and a
proprietary engine core (core/engine.js). The core is excluded from the
public repository via .gitignore and served from uuon.world in production.
The public shell contains zero algorithm logic. All computation is delegated
to window.AIBH.* exposed by the engine core.

